    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW27wdcZpy5tWFoUfsGvALeMr)_\n\nBefore: `sp-org-issues` was in `libraries/modules/text/`, while the other bespoke modules are now in `custom/`.\n\nAfter: `sp-org-issues.el` is in `libraries/modules/custom/`, listed in that section of the module tree in `docs/main.org`. Its literate doc is in `docs/tangles/custom/` (the first doc in the layout that mirrors `libraries/modules/`), with the tangle path and README link updated.\n\nHow: the `.el` is moved with `git mv` and unchanged; re-tangling the doc gives the same file. `init.el` loads it by name, so nothing else changes.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_013V6WSXthgpc9jPWyZsevsf)_",
